ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Abstract Expressionism
Board: /styles/abstract-expressionism
Companions: abstract-expressionism-starter.html, abstract-expressionism-study.ai, abstract-expressionism-study.psd

Document
3600 × 2400 px, 300 ppi. Ground #c2b6a2, the color of unsized canvas, not white.

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Bone arcs #d8d2c6, fewer than the black
- Red #8d1f2a, sparse
- Blue #243c66
- Black #1c1a17, the drawing
- Ground

Rules
Strokes are flat enamel, not glossy 3D tubes.
Crop so marks exit the canvas. No vignette. No subject.
Do not add a second artboard of stacked rectangles in this file.
